      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait so theyre not actually \"set\" as left or right until u look at them?? that sounds kinda spooky lol. i think i read somewhere einstein called it \"spooky action at a distance\" or something. why did he call it that specifically? was he just being dramatic or is there a reason it feels so weird?",
